# Raw forensic specimen workspaces (live, unneutralized malware corpora).
# These are analysis-only artifacts and must live outside the repository
# (see forensic evidence storage location, e.g. C:\forensics\<case>) rather
# than being committed here. Only malware-corpus/neutralized-artifacts/ and
# malware-corpus/specimens/ are tracked, defanged regression corpora.
malware-corpus/sbkortho/
malware-corpus/**/wp-admin/
malware-corpus/**/wp-includes/

